          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.18.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mt 18.17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " When one of you has a grievance against a brother, does he dare go to law before the unrighteous instead of the saints? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Do you not know that the saints will judge the world? And if the world is to be judged by you, are you incompetent to try trivial cases? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Do you not know that we are to judge angels? How much more, matters pertaining to this life! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If then you have such cases, why do you lay them before those who are least esteemed by the church? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I say this to your shame. Can it be that there is no man among you wise enough to decide between members of the brotherhood, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but brother goes to law against brother, and that before unbelievers?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
